{"q":"344","t":"Reverse String","d":"Easy","p":false,"c":"<p>Write a function that reverses a string. The input string is given as an array of characters <code>s</code>.</p>\n\n<p>You must do this by modifying the input array <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/In-place_algorithm\" target=\"_blank\">in-place</a> with <code>O(1)</code> extra memory.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n<pre><strong>Input:</strong> s = [\"h\",\"e\",\"l\",\"l\",\"o\"]\n<strong>Output:</strong> [\"o\",\"l\",\"l\",\"e\",\"h\"]\n</pre><p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n<pre><strong>Input:</strong> s = [\"H\",\"a\",\"n\",\"n\",\"a\",\"h\"]\n<strong>Output:</strong> [\"h\",\"a\",\"n\",\"n\",\"a\",\"H\"]\n</pre>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= s.length &lt;= 10<sup>5</sup></code></li>\n\t<li><code>s[i]</code> is a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ASCII#Printable_characters\" target=\"_blank\">printable ascii character</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n","h":["The entire logic for reversing a string is based on using the opposite directional two-pointer approach!"],"m":"{\n  \"name\": \"reverseString\",\n  \"params\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"s\",\n      \"type\": \"character[]\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"return\": {\n    \"type\": \"void\"\n  },\n  \"output\": {\n    \"paramindex\": 0\n  }\n}","g":[{"name":"Two Pointers","slug":"two-pointers"},{"name":"String","slug":"string"}],"s":[{"t":"Reverse Vowels of a String","s":"reverse-vowels-of-a-string","d":"Easy","p":false},{"t":"Reverse String II","s":"reverse-string-ii","d":"Easy","p":false}],"co":[["Google","google"],["Amazon","amazon"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["tcs","tcs"],["Meta","facebook"],["Qualcomm","qualcomm"],["Apple","apple"],["Goldman Sachs","goldman-sachs"],["EPAM Systems","epam-systems"],["Nvidia","nvidia"]],"cs":{"a":[["Google","google",10],["Amazon","amazon",9],["Microsoft","microsoft",4],["tcs","tcs",4],["Meta","facebook",2],["Bloomberg","bloomberg",2]],"b":[["Qualcomm","qualcomm",2]],"m":[["Apple","apple",5],["Goldman Sachs","goldman-sachs",3],["Infosys","infosys",2],["EPAM Systems","epam-systems",2],["Nvidia","nvidia",2],["Accenture","accenture",2],["HCL","hcl",2]]}}